WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:03.334
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:03.334 --> 00:00:05.133
You're here.
You made it.

00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:07.601
This is gonna be fun.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.601 --> 00:00:10.234
-Love you, Jimmy!
-I love you, too.

00:00:10.234 --> 00:00:11.434
-Whoo!
[ Laughter ]

00:00:11.434 --> 00:00:12.734
Well, guys,
this is very interesting.

00:00:12.734 --> 00:00:15.501
According to a new study,
men spread COVID

00:00:15.501 --> 00:00:18.167
more frequently
than women or children.

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:19.400
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:20.934
Yep, once again, "manspreading"

00:00:20.934 --> 00:00:23.133
is making life difficult
for everyone else.

00:00:23.133 --> 00:00:26.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.467 --> 00:00:29.367
Men were like, "You got us.
We finally did something wrong."

00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:32.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.234 --> 00:00:34.334
But here's some good news.
Today, Pfizer announced

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:36.267
that three doses of its vaccine

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:39.567
effectively fights
the omicron variant.

00:00:39.567 --> 00:00:43.667
Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:46.734
Yeah, everybody who panicked
last week was like,

00:00:46.734 --> 00:00:48.234
"Honey, where's the receipt

00:00:48.234 --> 00:00:50.033
for those 2,000 rolls
of toilet paper?"

00:00:50.033 --> 00:00:51.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.934 --> 00:00:54.467
Yep, it's a big day for Pfizer
and an even bigger day

00:00:54.467 --> 00:00:56.534
for the relieved
Denzel Washington GIF.

00:00:56.534 --> 00:01:00.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.667 --> 00:01:02.934
Meanwhile, everyone who just got
their third dose of Moderna

00:01:02.934 --> 00:01:05.400
is like,
"Um, anything you wanna tell us?

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:06.534
Uh..."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.534 --> 00:01:08.300
"We'll wait, we'll wait.
We're good."

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:09.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.834 --> 00:01:12.367
I saw that the prime minister
of Finland apologized

00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:14.901
for missing a message
saying to quarantine

00:01:14.901 --> 00:01:17.834
because she was out clubbing
till 4:00 a.m.

00:01:17.834 --> 00:01:22.901
and left her work phone at home.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.901 --> 00:01:24.234
Americans are shocked.
They were like,

00:01:24.234 --> 00:01:26.234
"You can leave
your work phone at home?"

00:01:26.234 --> 00:01:27.501
How does that work?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.501 --> 00:01:29.501
Meanwhile, the only time
Joe Biden's up at 4:00 a.m.

00:01:29.501 --> 00:01:32.133
is to use the bathroom.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:33.901
The only time Joe Biden
ever went clubbing

00:01:33.901 --> 00:01:36.033
is when he went
seal hunting as a boy.

00:01:36.033 --> 00:01:37.534
[ Laughter, audience groans ]

00:01:37.534 --> 00:01:42.534
Get this --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.534 --> 00:01:44.934
Get this --
in a new survey 1 in 3 people

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:46.968
said that during the pandemic
they had to work

00:01:46.968 --> 00:01:49.100
in either a bathroom
or a closet.

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:50.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.501 --> 00:01:52.667
Right now, New Yorkers are like,
"Yeah, I worked in a closet.

00:01:52.667 --> 00:01:55.334
It's called my apartment.
Hello?

00:01:55.334 --> 00:01:58.234
I can touch my oven
and my toilet at the same time.

00:01:58.234 --> 00:02:00.601
I can touch all the walls
in my place."

00:02:00.601 --> 00:02:03.300
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:05.167
Well, this is great news.
A Confederate statue

00:02:05.167 --> 00:02:08.367
that stood alongside
a Tennessee highway for 20 years

00:02:08.367 --> 00:02:10.267
has finally been removed.

00:02:10.267 --> 00:02:11.934
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah.

00:02:11.934 --> 00:02:14.033
Can we take a look
at the statute?

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:16.501
Oh.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.501 --> 00:02:18.868
Oh.
-Oh, man.

00:02:18.868 --> 00:02:20.334
-Well, people
are obviously happy

00:02:20.334 --> 00:02:21.667
that it's gone
for a number of reasons,

00:02:21.667 --> 00:02:23.400
so check out
what some of them are saying.

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:24.400
This person said...

00:02:27.934 --> 00:02:29.400
This person said...

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:34.000
The statue itself said...

00:02:36.367 --> 00:02:38.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.534
Then this person said...

00:02:42.133 --> 00:02:45.067
Then the statue of soccer star
Cristiano Ronaldo said...

00:02:46.033 --> 00:02:51.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.067 --> 00:02:52.901
Then this plaque
of Elvis Presley

00:02:52.901 --> 00:02:53.934
spoke up and said...

00:02:58.968 --> 00:03:01.567
And, finally, this statue
of Lucille Ball said...

00:03:07.267 --> 00:03:08.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:08.701 --> 00:03:11.567
So it seems like everyone's
on the same page.

00:03:11.567 --> 00:03:14.434
[ Applause ]

00:03:14.434 --> 00:03:16.634
Well, this is cool.
Computer scientists have created

00:03:16.634 --> 00:03:19.467
the world's smallest camera,
and it is the size

00:03:19.467 --> 00:03:20.901
of a grain of salt.
Look at this.

00:03:20.901 --> 00:03:22.868
Take a look at this.
[ Audience "Oohs" ]

00:03:22.868 --> 00:03:24.400
Even crazier,
it takes a photo

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:26.467
and then spits out
a very tiny Polaroid.

00:03:26.467 --> 00:03:30.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.934 --> 00:03:32.601
Scientists were like,
"As you can see --

00:03:32.601 --> 00:03:34.667
Oh, no. Crap.
Nobody move. Nobody --

00:03:34.667 --> 00:03:36.534
Nobody breathe."
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.534 --> 00:03:39.300
"There's $200,000 on the floor."

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:41.200
I read that the
U.S. Captioning Company

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:45.133
just released a list of its most
mispronounced words of 2021,

00:03:45.133 --> 00:03:47.534
and topping the list
is "cheugy."

00:03:47.534 --> 00:03:49.434
[ Light laughter ]
Cheugy, yeah.

00:03:49.434 --> 00:03:51.400
And if you don't believe me,
just turn on your local news.

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:52.567
Watch this.

00:03:52.567 --> 00:03:55.033
-Chew..."chew-gee"?

00:03:55.033 --> 00:03:57.501
-What the heck is "chew-gee"?
-"Chew-gee"?

00:03:57.501 --> 00:03:59.067
-"Chew-gee."
-"Chew-gee".

00:03:59.067 --> 00:04:00.467
-Have you ever heard
of "coo-gee"?

00:04:00.467 --> 00:04:02.701
-"Chu-gie".
-Called, "cho-gee".

00:04:02.701 --> 00:04:04.934
-Shug-- "Shug-ee"?

00:04:04.934 --> 00:04:06.467
I don't even know
what that means.

00:04:06.467 --> 00:04:08.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:08.767 --> 00:04:10.000
-"Cho-gie."

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.868
[ Applause ]

00:04:12.868 --> 00:04:15.567
Guys, I heard that dozens
of camels were just banned

00:04:15.567 --> 00:04:18.033
from a beauty contest
in Saudi Arabia

00:04:18.033 --> 00:04:20.000
because they received
Botox injections.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.868
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.868 --> 00:04:24.300
Not only that,
one camel was accused

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:27.834
of getting hump implants.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.834 --> 00:04:29.868
The camel beauty official
who made the decision said,

00:04:29.868 --> 00:04:31.667
"You're disqualified,
and what the hell

00:04:31.667 --> 00:04:34.501
am I doing with my life?"
[ Laughter ]

00:04:34.501 --> 00:04:36.701
They may be out of the
beauty contest for using Botox,

00:04:36.701 --> 00:04:38.601
but they just signed on
for the next season of

00:04:38.601 --> 00:04:41.734
"Real Camels of Saudi Arabia,"
so I'm excited to see that.

00:04:41.734 --> 00:04:43.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:43.067 --> 00:04:44.400
It's gonna be good.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:47.400
[ Applause ]

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:51.100
And, finally, a boater found
$1 million worth of cocaine

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:54.601
floating in the water
off the coast of Florida.

00:04:54.601 --> 00:04:56.767
Yep. The boater found it
by following a manatee

00:04:56.767 --> 00:04:58.400
that wouldn't shut up
about crypto.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:03.033
[ Laughter ]

00:05:03.033 --> 00:05:05.467
Though, if you didn't find
cocaine floating in the water,

00:05:05.467 --> 00:05:07.367
did you really
go boating in Florida?

00:05:07.367 --> 00:05:09.100
We have a great show.

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:11.300
Guys, we have exactly
eight shows left

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:13.467
before we go on Christmas break,
which means it's time

00:05:13.467 --> 00:05:15.667
for that beloved
"Tonight Show" tradition.

00:05:15.667 --> 00:05:18.501
It's time for
"12 Days of Christmas Sweaters."

00:05:18.501 --> 00:05:19.934
Here we go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:19.934 --> 00:05:22.267
-♪ 12 days
of Christmas sweaters ♪

00:05:22.267 --> 00:05:26.534
♪ Eight days left ♪

00:05:26.534 --> 00:05:27.601
-That is right!

00:05:27.601 --> 00:05:30.100
Every show
between now and Christmas,

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:32.601
