It's so nice to meet you.

00:07:06.067 --> 00:07:07.901
-Hey, where you from?
-I'm from Chicago.

00:07:07.901 --> 00:07:09.200
-Hey, welcome.

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:10.734
I'm so happy that you're here.
-Thank you so much!

00:07:10.734 --> 00:07:12.234
-Thank you for being here.

00:07:12.234 --> 00:07:13.901
Now, it's very cold in Chicago.

00:07:13.901 --> 00:07:15.734
Even when it's warm,
it's cold in Chicago.

00:07:15.734 --> 00:07:17.567
Do you have anything like this?

00:07:17.567 --> 00:07:20.067
-I have nothing like this.
The lapels are gorgeous.

00:07:20.067 --> 00:07:22.567
-Thank you so much.
I stitched it myself.

00:07:22.567 --> 00:07:25.067
Would you like to try it on?
-I would love to try it on.

00:07:25.067 --> 00:07:26.901
