Gorgeous.

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:32.901
Do you want to zip it?
Try zipping it.

00:07:32.901 --> 00:07:34.734
Yeah, you got to zip it.

00:07:34.734 --> 00:07:36.067
-Oh, yeah.
-Yes!

00:07:36.067 --> 00:07:37.234
Look at this.

00:07:37.234 --> 00:07:39.400
Look at that.
Are you kidding me?

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:41.067
